# An allowlist: everything is excluded from the build context except what the image
# needs. So .env (secrets), .git, the virtualenv, tests, caches and the downloaded speech
# models can never end up in an image - even ones added to the repository later.
*
!app/
!scripts/
!alembic/
!alembic.ini
!knowledge_base/
!frontend/
!requirements.txt
!requirements-voice.txt

**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
